---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="Survey — Web Software Technology 2015">

  <div class="article block">
    <p style="color:#999;font-size:0.9rem;"><a href="/webtech/homework">← 作业列表</a> · Unit 3/4</p>
    <h1>Survey — 调查问卷</h1>

    <p style="text-align:center;">
      <img src="/webtech/images/dialog-warning.png" alt="survey">
    </p>

    <p>这是 Unit 3 和 Unit 4 的作业——一个带 MySQL 数据库的调查问卷系统。</p>
    <p>原版为 PHP + MySQL + jQuery AJAX 实现，后端环境不再可用，以下是当时的功能描述：</p>

    <ul>
      <li>表单字段：姓名、年龄、性别、邮箱</li>
      <li>数据通过 jQuery AJAX POST 提交</li>
      <li>后端 PHP 存入 MySQL，用 Prepared Statement 防注入</li>
      <li>可查看投票结果</li>
    </ul>

    <div style="background:#f0f0f0;padding:20px;border-radius:6px;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;">
      <form id="frmsurvey" style="width:100%;">
        <p><label>Name</label> <input type="text" name="name" disabled style="width:60%;"></p>
        <p><label>Age</label> <input type="number" name="age" disabled style="width:60%;"></p>
        <p><label>Gender</label>
          <select name="gender" disabled style="width:60%;">
            <option>Male</option>
            <option>Female</option>
          </select>
        </p>
        <p><label>Email</label> <input type="email" name="email" disabled style="width:60%;"></p>
      </form>
      <p style="text-align:center;color:#999;font-size:0.85rem;">（表单已禁用 — 原始系统需要 PHP 后端）</p>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:1rem;color:#999;font-size:0.9rem;">
      <em>We've deployed a $1000 Intrusion Prevention System to stop hackers! Your IP address will be logged.</em>
    </p>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>
